# Runtime agent state — changes every session, never commit
.claude-flow/.trend-cache.json
.claude-flow/metrics/
# The daemon grew four more artifacts of the same class after this list was
# written, and the list did not keep up — so they sat untracked in every working
# tree instead. daemon.pid is a live PID (meaningless anywhere but this machine),
# daemon-state.json is running worker counters, and the proven-config pair plus
# policy/ are locally-adopted harness policy written mode 600 under a 700 dir.
# If any of these turns out to be intended as shared config, `git add -f` it and
# move it out of this block deliberately.
.claude-flow/daemon-state.json
.claude-flow/daemon.pid
.claude-flow/harness-active-policy.json
.claude-flow/policy/
.claude/proven-config.json
.claude/.proven-config-version

# Windows path junk that leaks into WSL
"C:\\Users\\*"
starlight-intelligence-system/.starlight/

# web-excellence pack — local evidence, not repo artifacts
.visual-proof/
.lighthouse.json
.extract-design-system/
.claude/skills/.replaced/
